{
  "_comment": "Tune the Job Hunt ranker here. To personalize it for ANY resume, drop a plain-text 'resume.txt' (or resume.md) in this folder — or paste one into the Resume tab in the app: the ranker reads it and scores jobs against the skills it finds (matched against skillVocabulary below), and the Skill Gaps tab tells you which vocabulary skills the postings want that your resume is missing. With no resume file it falls back to the fixed skillWeights. Matching is keyword-based and explainable. Edit, then click 'Reload extensions' in Settings (no restart needed).",

